sequenceDiagram
  participant Sched as scheduler.run_nvd_incremental_sync
  participant NVD as feeds/nvd.py
  participant DB as database.upsert_cves
  participant T as cves table
  participant API as GET /api/cves
  participant Feed as CVEFeed.jsx
  participant Card as CVECard.jsx

  Sched->>NVD: fetch_nvd_cve_updates(watermark)
  NVD-->>Sched: parsed CVE dicts
  Sched->>DB: upsert_cves + set_nvd_sync_watermark
  DB->>T: ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE
  Feed->>API: fetchCVEs(filters, page, limit)
  API->>T: SELECT with filters + pagination
  T-->>API: rows
  API-->>Feed: total, page, data[]
  Feed->>Card: render each CVE in list
  Note over Card: Risk score uses list fields only;<br/>momentum defaults to 0 until drawer opens
